ork</a></span><br /><span class=\"nowrap\"><span style=\"cursor:help;\" title=\"Pr\u00eat\u00e9 \u00e0\">\u2192</span> <a href=\"/wiki/Knicks_de_Westchester\" title=\"Knicks de Westchester\">Knicks de Westchester</a></span><br />Knicks de New York</td><td valign=\"top\"><s style=\"visibility:hidden;color:transparent\">0</s>2,5<br /><s style=\"visibility:hidden;color:transparent\">0</s>1,5<br />10,2<br /><s style=\"visibility:hidden;color:transparent\">0</s>7,2<br /><abbr title=\"N&#39;a pas jou\u00e9\">DNP</abbr><br /><s style=\"visibility:hidden;color:transparent\">0</s>8,4<br /><s style=\"visibility:hidden;color:transparent\">0</s>5,0<br /><s style=\"visibility:hidden;color:transparent\">0</s>1,9<br /><s style=\"visibility:hidden;color:transparent\">0</s>7,3<br /><s style=\"visibility:hidden;color:transparent\">0</s>2,2</td></tr>\n<tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<td colspan=\"3\"><hr style=\"height:2px; color:inherit; background-color:#DD8F56;\" /></td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;color:#555555;\"><small>* Points marqu\u00e9s dans chaque club dans le cadre de la saison r\u00e9guli\u00e8re du championnat national.</small></td>\n</tr><tr>\n\n<td class=\"navigation-only\" colspan=\"3\" style=\"border-top: 2px #DD8F56 solid; font-size: 80%; background:inherit; color: inherit; text-align: right;\"><span class=\"plainlinks\" style=\"float:left;\"><a class=\"external text\" data-mw-original-href=\"//fr.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=Ariel_Hukporti&amp;action=edit&amp;section=0\" href=\"https://fr.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=Ariel_Hukporti&amp;action=edit&amp;section=0\"><span class=\"infodoc\">modifier</span></a></span>&#160;<span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Mod%C3%A8le:Infobox_Joueur_de_basket-ball\" title=\"Consultez la documentation du mod\u00e8le\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/38/Info_Simple.svg/20px-Info_Simple.svg.png?utm_source=fr.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"12\" height=\"12\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/38/Info_Simple.svg/40px-Info_Simple.svg.png?utm_source=fr.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"512\" data-file-height=\"512\" /></a></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><b>Ariel Washington Hukporti</b>, n\u00e9 le  <time class=\"nowrap date-lien\" datetime=\"2002-04-12\" data-sort-value=\"2002-04-12\"><a href=\"/wiki/12_avril_en_sport\" title=\"12 avril en sport\">12 avril</a> <a href=\"/wiki/2002_en_basket-ball\" title=\"2002 en basket-ball\">2002</a></time> \u00e0 <a href=\"/wiki/Stralsund\" title=\"Stralsund\">Stralsund</a> en <a href=\"/wiki/Allemagne\" title=\"Allemagne\">Allemagne</a>, est un joueur <a href=\"/wiki/Allemagne\" title=\"Allemagne\">germano</a>-<a href=\"/wiki/Togo\" title=\"Togo\">togolais</a> de <a href=\"/wiki/Basket-ball\" title=\"Basket-ball\">basket-ball</a> mesurant 2,11 m et \u00e9voluant au poste de <a href=\"/wiki/Pivot_(basket-ball)\" title=\"Pivot (basket-ball)\">pivot</a>.\n</p>\n<meta property=\"mw:PageProp/toc\" />\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Biographie\">Biographie</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Ariel_Hukporti&amp;veaction=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Modifier la section\u202f: Biographie\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>modifier</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Ariel_Hukporti&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Modifier le code source de la section : Biographie\"><span>modifier le code</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"bandeau-container bandeau-section metadata bandeau-niveau-information\"><div class=\"bandeau-cell bandeau-icone\"><span class=\"mw-valign-text-top noviewer\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fichier:Logo_travaux_orange-simple.svg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d5/Logo_travaux_orange-simple.svg/20px-Logo_travaux_orange-simple.svg.png?utm_source=fr.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"13\" height=\"17\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d5/Logo_travaux_orange-simple.svg/40px-Logo_travaux_orange-simple.svg.png?utm_source=fr.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"512\" data-file-height=\"640\" /></a></span></div><div class=\"bandeau-cell\">Cette section est vide, insuffisamment d\u00e9taill\u00e9e ou incompl\u00e8te. <a href=\"/wiki/Sp%C3%A9cial:EditPage/Ariel_Hukporti\" title=\"Sp\u00e9cial:EditPage/Ariel Hukporti\">Votre aide</a> est la bienvenue&#160;! <a href=\"/wiki/Aide:Comment_modifier_une_page\" title=\"Aide:Comment modifier une page\">Comment faire&#160;?</a></div></div>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"Carri\u00e8re_professionnelle\"><span id=\"Carri.C3.A8re_professionnelle\"></span>Carri\u00e8re professionnelle</h3><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Ariel_Hukporti&amp;veaction=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Modifier la section\u202f: Carri\u00e8re professionnelle\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>modifier</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Ariel_Hukporti&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Modifier le code source de la section : Carri\u00e8re professionnelle\"><span>modifier le code</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"bandeau-container bandeau-section metadata bandeau-niveau-information\"><div class=\"bandeau-cell bandeau-icone\"><span class=\"mw-valign-text-top noviewer\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fichier:Logo_travaux_orange-simple.svg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d5/Logo_travaux_orange-simple.svg/20px-Logo_travaux_orange-simple.svg.png?utm_source=fr.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"13\" height=\"17\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d5/Logo_travaux_orange-simple.svg/40px-Logo_travaux_orange-simple.svg.png?utm_source=fr.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"512\" data-file-height=\"640\" /></a></span></div><div class=\"bandeau-cell\">Cette section est vide, insuffisamment d\u00e9taill\u00e9e ou incompl\u00e8te. <a href=\"/wiki/Sp%C3%A9cial:EditPage/Ariel_Hukporti\" title=\"Sp\u00e9cial:EditPage/Ariel Hukporti\">Votre aide</a> est la bienvenue&#160;! <a href=\"/wiki/Aide:Comment_modifier_une_page\" title=\"Aide:Comment modifier une page\">Comment faire&#160;?</a></div></div>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading4\"><h4 id=\"Knicks_de_New_York_(depuis_2024)\"><span id=\"Knicks_de_New_York_.28depuis_2024.29\"></span>Knicks de New York (depuis 2024)</h4><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Ariel_Hukporti&amp;veaction=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Modifier la section\u202f: Knicks de New York (depuis 2024)\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>modifier</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Ariel_Hukporti&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Modifier le code source de la section : Knicks de New York (depuis 2024)\"><span>modifier le code</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<p>Le <time class=\"nowrap\" datetime=\"2024-06-27\" data-sort-value=\"2024-06-27\">27 juin 2024</time>, il est s\u00e9lectionn\u00e9 \u00e0 la <abbr class=\"abbr\" title=\"Cinquante-huiti\u00e8me\">58<sup>e</sup></abbr> position de la <a href=\"/wiki/Draft_2024_de_la_NBA\" title=\"Draft 2024 de la NBA\">draft 2024 de la NBA</a> par les <a href=\"/wiki/Mavericks_de_Dallas\" title=\"Mavericks de Dallas\">Mavericks de Dallas</a>. Le m\u00eame jour, ses droits sont \u00e9chang\u00e9s aux <a href=\"/wiki/Knicks_de_New_York\" title=\"Knicks de New York\">Knicks de New York</a> en \u00e9change de <a href=\"/wiki/Melvin_Ajin%C3%A7a\" title=\"Melvin Ajin\u00e7a\">Melvin Ajin\u00e7a</a><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>.\n</p><p>En <time class=\"nowrap\" datetime=\"2024-07\" data-sort-value=\"2024-07\">juillet 2024</time>, il signe un contrat <i>two-way</i> avec les Knicks<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>. En <time class=\"nowrap\" datetime=\"2024-11\" data-sort-value=\"2024-11\">novembre 2024</time>, son contrat <i>two-way</i> est converti en un contrat standard.\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Palmar\u00e8s_et_distinctions_personnelles\"><span id=\"Palmar.C3.A8s_et_distinctions_personnelles\"></span>Palmar\u00e8s et distinctions personnelles</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Ariel_Hukporti&amp;veaction=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Modifier la section\u202f: Palmar\u00e8s et distinctions personnelles\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>modifier</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Ariel_Hukporti&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Modifier le code source de la section : Palmar\u00e8s et distinctions personnelles\"><span>modifier le code</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<p>Avec les <a href=\"/wiki/Knicks_de_New_York\" title=\"Knicks de New York\">Knicks de New York</a>&#160;:\n</p>\n<ul><li>Vainqueur de la <a href=\"/wiki/NBA_Cup_2025\" title=\"NBA Cup 2025\">NBA Cup en 2025</a></li>\n<li>Champion de la <a href=\"/wiki/Conf%C3%A9rence_Est_de_la_NBA\" title=\"Conf\u00e9rence Est de la NBA\">Conf\u00e9rence Est</a> en 2026</li>\n<li>Champion <a href=\"/wiki/NBA\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"NBA\">NBA</a> en <a href=\"/wiki/Saison_NBA_2025-2026\" title=\"Saison NBA 2025-2026\">2026</a>.</li></ul>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Statistiques\">Statistiques</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Ariel_Hukporti&amp;veaction=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Modifier la section\u202f: Statistiques\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>modifier</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Ariel_Hukporti&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Modifier le code source de la section : Statistiques\"><span>modifier le code</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"bandeau-container bandeau-section metadata bandeau-niveau-information\"><div class=\"bandeau-cell bandeau-icone\"><span class=\"mw-valign-text-top noviewer\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fichier:Logo_travaux_orange-simple.svg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d5/Logo_travaux_orange-simple.svg/20px-Logo_travaux_orange-simple.svg.png?utm_source=fr.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"13\" height=\"17\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d5/Logo_travaux_orange-simple.svg/40px-Logo_travaux_orange-simple.svg.png?utm_source=fr.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"512\" data-file-height=\"640\" /></a></span></div><div cla